# From "Advanced Focus 12" (Wave V - Exploring Focus 15, CD1-1): a short
# reinforcement of Focus 12 with an open menu -- the tape names patterning,
# reopening a communication point, and NVC practice as options, all of which
# now exist as their own segments (patterning.gws, compoint.gws, nvc-i.gws).

@segment  advanced-focus-12
@title    Advanced Focus 12
@levels   F12
@duration ~3m

say Return to Focus 12, and reinforce it. Let your consciousness expand even further, deeper, well beyond your five physical senses.
pause 10
say In this expanded state, you're free to explore however you choose. Set new patterns for your life. Reopen a communication point with someone. Practice nonverbal communication. Or simply observe and experience.
pause 8
say Use this time however serves you. I'll call you when it's done.
hold 180
say Return now to normal Focus 12.
pause 6
say Calm and comfortable, back in Focus 12.
pause 5
